# Agent memory directory

This directory is managed by the SDLC harness agent's `FileMemoryProvider`.
Files written here persist between workflow runs and are committed to the
repository so agent state is version-controlled and reviewable.

- `sessions/` — per-session working notes (auto-created by the harness)
- `notes.md` — durable cross-session memory (auto-created by the harness)

Do not edit these files manually unless debugging agent behavior.
